---
import { INSTALLERS, href } from '../lib/site';

const mac = INSTALLERS.filter((i) => i.os === 'macOS');
const win = INSTALLERS.find((i) => i.os === 'Windows')!;
const linux = INSTALLERS.find((i) => i.os === 'Linux')!;
---

<section id="install" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Install</span>
      <h2>Up And Running In Five Minutes.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Every installer ships with its own Java runtime. The builds are not
        notarised or code-signed, so the operating system may ask you to
        confirm the first launch.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <header>
          <span class="step">1</span>
          <h3>macOS</h3>
        </header>
        <ol>
          <li>Download the <code>.dmg</code> for your chip and drag LINCE PLUS to Applications.</li>
          <li>
            On first launch macOS may block the app. Open <strong>System Settings &rarr; Privacy &amp; Security</strong>
            and choose <em>Open Anyway</em>.
          </li>
        </ol>
        <div class="dl">
          {mac.map((i) => (
            <a class="btn btn-teal btn-sm" href={i.url} download>{i.label}</a>
          ))}
        </div>
        <details>
          <summary>What the security dialog looks like</summary>
          <img
            src={href('/img/mac-install-warning.png')}
            alt="macOS dialog warning that LINCE PLUS cannot be verified, with the Open Anyway option"
            loading="lazy"
            width="1170"
            height="629"
          />
          <p>
            Apple's guide:
            <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT202491" rel="noopener" target="_blank">English</a> &middot;
            <a href="https://support.apple.com/es-es/guide/mac-help/mh40616/mac" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Español</a>
          </p>
        </details>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <header>
          <span class="step">2</span>
          <h3>Windows</h3>
        </header>
        <ol>
          <li>Download and run the <code>.exe</code> installer.</li>
          <li>If SmartScreen appears, choose <em>More info &rarr; Run anyway</em>.</li>
          <li>Follow the wizard. Windows 10 or later, x64.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="dl">
          <a class="btn btn-teal btn-sm" href={win.url} download>Windows x64</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <header>
          <span class="step">3</span>
          <h3>Linux</h3>
        </header>
        <ol>
          <li>Download the <code>.sh</code> installer and make it executable.</li>
          <li>Run it. The default install path is <code>/opt/lince-plus</code>, with menu and desktop shortcuts.</li>
        </ol>
        <pre><code>chmod +x {linux.file}
./{linux.file}</code></pre>
        <div class="dl">
          <a class="btn btn-teal btn-sm" href={linux.url} download>Linux x64</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  header h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .step {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--teal-400);
    color: var(--fg-on-teal);
    font-weight: 800;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  ol {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    color: var(--fg-2);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  ol li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  strong {
    color: var(--fg-1);
  }
  .dl {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .dl .btn {
    width: auto;
  }
  pre {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--ink-900);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  pre code {
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--teal-200);
  }
  details {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--fg-brand);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  details img {
    margin: 12px 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
  details p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
